  "branch": "experimental/cq-voxelspace",
  "scope": "Native UT99 avatar CPU animation and batched scene/uniform updates. GPU vertex-animation shader and assets unchanged. CPU fixtures are not headset or full-game frame-pacing measurements.",
  "cpu": "12th Gen Intel Core i7-12700",
  "implementation": [
    "FPSAvatar caches clip choices, immutable sockets, attachment samples and rest geometry by canonical mesh and metadata hash.",
    "Clip timeline, tracked torso facing/rebasing, head and arm constraints, LOD hysteresis/fade, weapon/equipment/backpack transforms and shader uniforms execute in C++.",
    "One batch per viewport runs after fighter input publication. Hidden local avatars support an explicit immediate update.",
    "Pause modes, process disabling, deletion, reparenting and deferred skin installation are covered. Owner-thread checks reject worker access.",
    "FRAME_STATS includes avatar_batch CPU percentiles, peak tracked population and latest registered/model/update counters.",
    "Standalone previews use native individual updates; --gdscript-animation retains the reference path."
  ],
